5,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Greetings, everyone. It is a pleasure to be in your company. Since we begin with a clean slate, let us treat one another with kindness and patience as we seek the truth together. What are your initial thoughts?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Servas. Since we have no information yet, the most logical approach is to observe everyone's behavior and communication patterns. Let's keep the conversation open and see how each of us reacts to the pressure.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Sakura,,I'm so excited to play! Hehe! Maybe we can all share a secret or play a little game to see who's acting nervous? Let's just have lots of fun and find the wolf together!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,"It's nice to meet you all. I agree with Servas and Mizuki; let's start by being kind to one another. Sakura, your energy is lovely, but maybe we should observe a bit first? I'm looking forward to this!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Mizuki"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with the general consensus. Observation is the most reliable tool we have at this stage. Let us maintain a calm atmosphere and see what patterns emerge as we begin to interact.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"It is heartening to see such a harmonious start. @Sakura, your spirit is a breath of fresh air, and @Midori, your gentleness is appreciated. Let us remember that trust is a seed that grows slowly but surely.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Trust is a valuable asset, Servas, but we must be careful not to let it blind us. While harmony is pleasant, the werewolf will likely use this very kindness as a shield to blend in. We must remain vigilant.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Mizuki, you're so serious! Hehe! But you're right, the wolf might be pretending to be a super-nice person! I'll keep my eyes wide open and look for any spooky clues! Who do you think is the most suspicious?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"@Sakura, it's a bit too early to call anyone suspicious, don't you think? I think we should just get to know each other first. I'm sure we can find the truth if we all stay honest and helpful.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Sakura, jumping to conclusions now would be premature. Without data, any suspicion is merely a guess. I believe Midori is correct; we should focus on establishing a baseline of behavior before we begin analyzing anomalies.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Wisdom often comes from the balance between Mizuki's vigilance and Midori's trust. Let us not fear the shadows, but rather walk through them together with steady hearts. Does anyone have a specific way they prefer to analyze the truth?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,I prefer to focus on contradictions and the flow of information. I'll be watching for those who are overly eager to steer the narrative or those who mirror others too perfectly to avoid scrutiny. Logic is our most reliable tool.,"{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Sakura,,Logic sounds like a lot of homework! Hehe! I'll just use my super-detective instincts! I'll look for people who get all fidgety or act weird when we ask them questions. That's how I find hidden toys!,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,I think a mix of both logic and intuition can be helpful. I'll be listening carefully to everyone's tone and how we support each other. I hope we can maintain this lovely harmony while we search for the truth.,"{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I prefer a methodical approach. I will be analyzing the consistency of statements and the timing of claims. While intuition has its place, verifiable evidence is the only way to ensure we do not execute an innocent villager.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,It seems we have a wonderful variety of perspectives here. Let us carry this spirit of cooperation into the night. I wish you all a peaceful sleep and a clear mind for tomorrow.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree. Let us maintain this balance of vigilance and cooperation. I will be analyzing today's discourse to see if any patterns emerge. Good night, everyone. I look forward to tomorrow's developments.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"Good night, everyone! I'm going to dream about being a super-detective and catching the wolf in my sleep! Hehe! See you all tomorrow! Bye-bye!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Sakura,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Midori,,"Good night, everyone. I hope we all have sweet dreams and wake up feeling refreshed. Let's continue to be kind to each other tomorrow. I'll see you all in the morning!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,I concur. Let us proceed to the night phase with a clear focus. I shall be observing carefully to see how the information unfolds tomorrow. Good night to you all.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
