36,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope the night brought you peace and clarity. As we enter this new day, I wonder if our Seer has found a light to guide us through the shadows. Please, share your thoughts when you feel ready.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Good morning. Now that the first night has passed, the Seer has their first result. If anyone feels confident enough to share their findings or has noticed something suspicious, please speak up. Let's be cautious but decisive.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I'm awake! Hehe! I wonder if the Seer found a big, scary wolf already? @everyone, does anyone feel like they're acting a little bit different today? I'm watching you all very closely with my detective eyes!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all slept well. I'm a bit nervous, but I agree with Mizuki; it would be helpful to know if the Seer found anything. @Seer, please only share if you feel it's safe!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I have information. I am the Seer, and my divination reveals that Mizuki is the werewolf. This is a concrete fact that we must act upon to ensure the village's safety.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Ryuji, that is a most startling revelation. To find the truth so early is a blessing, yet it brings a heavy burden to our hearts. @Mizuki, how do you respond to such a serious claim?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Ryuji, that is a very bold claim to make so early. While you present it as a concrete fact, we must consider that a werewolf would also claim the Seer role to eliminate a threat or frame an innocent. Why choose me as your first target?","{""words"":46,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Wow! A real clue already?! Hehe! @Ryuji, you're like a superhero! But @Mizuki looks really surprised! Is this a big plot twist? I'm getting goosebumps! What do you guys think? Is Ryuji telling the truth?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Ryuji, that's a very shocking start to the morning. I want to believe you, but @Mizuki's point about the werewolf pretending to be the Seer is something we should consider. It's so hard to know who to trust right now.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mizuki, my choice of target was based on a desire to eliminate the most significant threat as quickly as possible. Your focus on logic and vigilance is a common mask for a wolf. The fact remains: my divination is clear.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Servas,,"It is a delicate moment for us all. While Ryuji's certainty is a powerful beacon, we must ensure we are not blinded by it. @Mizuki, your logic is sound, but can you offer us a reason to doubt the Seer's vision?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Servas, the reason to doubt is simple: if Ryuji is the werewolf, he has just secured a way to execute me and potentially the Seer later by establishing himself as the sole source of truth. This is a classic deception.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Ryuji, you're so sure! But @Mizuki is acting like a detective too! Hehe, it's like a battle of the brains! If Ryuji is a fake Seer, that would be a super sneaky trick! Who's lying? I can't tell!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Ryuji, @Mizuki, please don't fight. It's heartbreaking to see us argue so soon. If Ryuji is telling the truth, we're safe, but if he's not, we've made a terrible mistake. Does anyone else have a feeling about this?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Midori, emotions are not a reliable metric in this game. @Mizuki, your attempt to frame my revelation as a ""classic deception"" is a predictable defensive maneuver. The most logical path to victory is to trust the Seer's divination.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Servas,,"We stand at a crossroads where trust and doubt meet. While Ryuji's claim is direct, the risk of a mistake is great. Let us weigh the evidence with calm hearts. Who among us feels the truth lies with Ryuji?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@Servas, we must not let the allure of a quick victory cloud our judgment. If we execute based on a single claim without verification, we are gambling with the village's life. I urge everyone to consider the risk of a fake Seer.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"This is so hard! Hehe! @Ryuji is so confident, but @Mizuki is super smart! If we pick the wrong person, the wolf wins! I'll just follow my detective heart... but my heart is confused! Who should we vote for?!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I really don't want to make a mistake and hurt someone innocent. @Ryuji, your confidence is strong, but @Mizuki's warning is also important. I'm so torn... I'll trust the group's feeling, but I hope we're doing the right thing.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"The risk of a mistake is indeed present, but the risk of leaving a confirmed werewolf among us is far greater. I have provided the truth; the most rational decision is to execute Mizuki now.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
